### Variáveis
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@adminUser = admin
@adminPassword = admin123
@commonUser = user
@commonPassword = user123

### Listar destinos — público
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/destinos

### Pesquisar destinos — público
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/destinos/pesquisar?nome=Noronha&localizacao=Pernambuco

### Buscar destino por ID — público
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/destinos/1

### Cadastrar destino — somente ADMIN
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/destinos
Authorization: Basic {{adminUser}} {{adminPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Bonito",
  "localizacao": "Mato Grosso do Sul, Brasil",
  "descricao": "Destino conhecido pelo ecoturismo."
}

### Atualizar destino — somente ADMIN
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/destinos/1
Authorization: Basic {{adminUser}} {{adminPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Fernando de Noronha",
  "localizacao": "Pernambuco, Brasil",
  "descricao": "Arquipélago brasileiro com áreas de preservação ambiental."
}

### Avaliar destino — USER ou ADMIN
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/destinos/1/avaliar
Authorization: Basic {{commonUser}} {{commonPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nota": 9.5
}

### Excluir destino — somente ADMIN
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/destinos/1
Authorization: Basic {{adminUser}} {{adminPassword}}

### Listar usuários — somente ADMIN
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios
Authorization: Basic {{adminUser}} {{adminPassword}}

### Cadastrar usuário — somente ADMIN
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios
Authorization: Basic {{adminUser}} {{adminPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "operador",
  "password": "senhaSegura123",
  "role": "ROLE_USER"
}
